{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"musket","model_identifier":"musket","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## musket\n\nRanged weapon, gunpowder.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.9..1.5, y -3.2..2.8, z -44.5..10.0 (size 2.4 x 6.0 x 54.5 u = 7 x 17 x 153 cm).\nFlintlock musket, about 1.5 m (55 u): walnut-brown full stock with a deep butt, metal barrel with two barrel bands and a muzzle ring, ramrod under the barrel, lock plate on the right with a black flint in the cock and an upright frizzen, trigger guard. Grip (right hand at the wrist of the stock) at the origin; muzzle 44.5 u forward (-Z), butt plate 10 u back. Second grip (left hand under the fore-stock) 9.3 u forward (warrior_base musket_fire). Barrel/lock textures: iron grades, steel (steel barrel), high-quality steel.\n- Embedded texture: iron_refined. Tier textures: iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n- Muzzle point for the game's flash: (0, 1.25, -44.5).\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `musket_iron_bloom.png`, `musket_iron_wrought.png`, `musket_iron_refined.png`, `musket_steel.png`, `musket_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## musket\n\nRanged weapon, gunpowder.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.9..1.5, y -3.2..2.8, z -44.5..10.0 (size 2.4 x 6.0 x 54.5 u = 7 x 17 x 153 cm).\nFlintlock musket, about 1.5 m (55 u): walnut-brown full stock with a deep butt, metal barrel with two barrel bands and a muzzle ring, ramrod under the barrel, lock plate on the right with a black flint in the cock and an upright frizzen, trigger guard. Grip (right hand at the wrist of the stock) at the origin; muzzle 44.5 u forward (-Z), butt plate 10 u back. Second grip (left hand under the fore-stock) 9.3 u forward (warrior_base musket_fire).